### Step 1: Clear resources for the first tenant
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/dev/seed/tenant/61b3cdbd-daf7-4acc-b958-dd40ff800083/resources
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Step 2: Clear resources for the second tenant  
